<!-- About Section -->
<section id="about" class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Executive Summary</h2>
        <div class="about-content">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p class="lead">
                    Architect-level engineer evolved into technology leadership — building systems designed
                    for correctness, durability, and long-term operational stability over short-term trends.
                </p>
                <p>
                    My trajectory spans hands-on engineering to architectural ownership to leading distributed
                    teams. I operate with a systems-first mindset: understanding that architecture is risk
                    management, and that production systems demand ownership, not delegation.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I combine deep technical expertise with building and mentoring high-performing teams
                    that consistently deliver measurable results and sustainable systems — a trail of success
                    that continues long after transition. Not a trend chaser; I favor fundamentals and outcomes.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Trusted change agent bridging engineering, product, and business outcomes. I lead
                    transformation across product lines, cloud modernization, and AI initiatives while
                    maintaining comfort with scale, outages, audits, and accountability.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Proven in regulated environments, government platforms, enterprise SaaS, and
                    high-reliability systems where failure is not an option.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stats">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <span class="stat-number">12+</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Years Experience</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <span class="stat-number">8+</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Engineers Led</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <span class="stat-number">20+</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Technologies</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

