<!-- Selected Impact Section -->
<section id="impact" class="impact-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Selected Impact</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Systems built, problems solved, outcomes delivered</p>
        <div class="impact-grid">
            <div class="impact-card">
                <div class="impact-header">
                    <span class="impact-type">Smart City / ITS Systems</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Real-Time Traffic Intelligence Platform</h3>
                <div class="impact-body">
                    <p><strong>Problem:</strong> Legacy traffic management systems couldn't handle real-time data ingestion at scale or provide actionable insights to city operators.</p>
                    <p><strong>Approach:</strong> Designed event-driven architecture for real-time telemetry processing. Implemented distributed data pipelines with fault tolerance. Built operator dashboards with sub-second latency.</p>
                    <p><strong>Trade-offs:</strong> Chose eventual consistency over strong consistency to maintain throughput; accepted increased complexity for horizontal scalability.</p>
                    <p><strong>Outcome:</strong> Platform processes millions of events daily across multiple city deployments with 99.9% uptime.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-card">
                <div class="impact-header">
                    <span class="impact-type">Cloud Modernization</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Legacy System Migration & Stabilization</h3>
                <div class="impact-body">
                    <p><strong>Problem:</strong> Monolithic .NET application with brittle deployment process, frequent outages, and inability to scale during peak loads.</p>
                    <p><strong>Approach:</strong> Incremental strangler pattern migration. Containerized services, established CI/CD pipelines, implemented comprehensive monitoring before any feature work.</p>
                    <p><strong>Trade-offs:</strong> Prioritized stability over speed; delayed new features to establish operational foundation first.</p>
                    <p><strong>Outcome:</strong> Reduced deployment failures by 80%, achieved zero-downtime deployments, enabled horizontal scaling.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-card">
                <div class="impact-header">
                    <span class="impact-type">AI-Driven Automation</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Intelligent Document Processing Platform</h3>
                <div class="impact-body">
                    <p><strong>Problem:</strong> Manual document review processes consuming significant engineering and operations time with inconsistent results.</p>
                    <p><strong>Approach:</strong> Built RAG pipeline with vector search for document understanding. Implemented AI agents for automated extraction and validation. Maintained human-in-the-loop for edge cases.</p>
                    <p><strong>Trade-offs:</strong> Invested in robust evaluation framework before deployment; accepted longer development cycle for production reliability.</p>
                    <p><strong>Outcome:</strong> 70% reduction in manual review time while maintaining accuracy standards.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-card">
                <div class="impact-header">
                    <span class="impact-type">Platform Engineering</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Engineering Team & Platform Buildout</h3>
                <div class="impact-body">
                    <p><strong>Problem:</strong> Scaling engineering organization while maintaining code quality, delivery velocity, and team cohesion across distributed teams.</p>
                    <p><strong>Approach:</strong> Established clear ownership boundaries, implemented code review standards, built shared tooling and documentation. Focused on hiring for ownership mindset over specific skills.</p>
                    <p><strong>Trade-offs:</strong> Slower initial hiring to maintain quality bar; invested heavily in onboarding and mentorship.</p>
                    <p><strong>Outcome:</strong> Built and retained high-performing team delivering production systems with measurable business impact.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

